  "vendor_website": "daikinapplied.com",
  "description": "MicroTech chiller unit controller over Modbus RTU: enable, mode, setpoints, capacity, current and power, fluid temperatures and flows, economizer, alarms, pumps, clock, units, model and software version",
  "revision": 1,
  "source": "Daikin Applied, MicroTech Chiller Unit Controller Protocol Information, ED 15121-13 (September 2026), tables 4, 7 and 8",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "MicroTech Chiller Unit Controller Protocol Information",
      "version": "ED 15121-13, September 2026",
      "url": "https://tahoeweb.daikinapplied.com/api/general/DownloadDocumentByName/media/ED15121-13.pdf/",
      "note": "tables 4 (chiller), 7 (pumps) and 8 (misc)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-15",
      "sha256": "96e655976f50b8e3546b7ce5e6cb7938c0581ad934d99e6fb5e67aef3b0e75c9"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU through the communication module. Register numbers are those of the document (40001 shown as 1), sent one lower (address_base 1). All data are holding registers.",
    "Values marked x 10 are sent multiplied by 10; temperatures, pressures and flows are English or metric as set by register 316. Two-register values are high word first.",
    "Not every point exists on every model: table 3 of the document lists the points per model.",
    "Circuit and compressor data points (tables 5 and 6) are not in this map.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's document; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 1,
  "x_status": "official",
